{"product":{"id":5070334492807,"title":"POLYGON - Particle FX Pack","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe title=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Y3az8jkS0FU\" class=\"ratio-16-by-9\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSynty® Studios presents: POLYGON - Particle FX Pack\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA particle FX asset pack including fire, water, smoke, dust, dirt, blood, nature, weapons, magic and more, to add to your POLYGON or low-poly style project.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWatch a showcase of this pack in Unreal Engine on \u003ca rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/youtu.be\/V-6sXvu4D6c\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eYouTube\u003c\/a\u003e. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e◼\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e◼\u003cbr\u003e- 120+ particle FX\u003cbr\u003e- FX designed to complement the POLYGON asset series\u003cbr\u003e- Lightweight particles to keep performance running smoothly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cb\u003e📦 Pack Content\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eParticle FX\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e- Bubble FX (x2)\u003cbr\u003e- Gore FX (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Cartoony FX (x5)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Confetti FX (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- UI FX (x3)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Dust FX (x3)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Electricity FX (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Explosion FX (x4)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Fireworks FX (x5)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Fire FX (x16)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Bug FX (x3)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Fog FX (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Ground FX (x1)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Lazer FX (x1)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Lightning FX (x1)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Impact FX (x8)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Nature FX (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Loot FX (x6)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Pickup FX (x6)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Poison FX (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Magic FX (x26)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Rain FX (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Shard FX (x8)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Weapon FX (x22)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Slash FX (x4)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Smoke FX (x8)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Snow (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Spark FX (x6)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Stunned FX (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Steam FX (x5)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Light FX (x4)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Swirl FX (x4)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Trail FX (x4)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Water FX (x2)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Wind FX (x3)\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Nuke FX (x2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e* Content may differ between engines\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e🤖 Technical Info\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e◼ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e◼\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e- Compatible with Unreal Engine 5.3+\u003cbr\u003e- Compatible with Unity 2022.3+\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Characters set up with Mecanim (No animations included)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u00